NorwayJournalsConfirm=Confirm creation of missing journals
NorwayJournalsSaved=Created %s journals. Existing journals and entries were preserved.
NorwayJournalsFailed=Creation could not be confirmed. Create a new preview and check the journal register before retrying.
NorwayJournalsNothing=All four journal types have active coded journals. This does not verify bank mappings or correct posting.

NorwayCompanyFieldsHelp=Open Company/organisation and save Norway as the country first. Under company identifiers: the organisation number is nine digits without NO or MVA. Legal form is the registered form, such as ENK or AS; select it yourself. The VAT number is a separate field for registered businesses and does not replace the organisation number. Do not add VAT registration wording before registration is confirmed. The VAT-liable setting and registration effective date require separate assessment. Updating does not select a legal form or change numbers or VAT status.


NorwayVatAutoInvalid=Could not fill VAT number. Provide a valid Norwegian organisation number before saving with VAT used and an empty VAT field.
NorwayVatAutoHelp=With VAT used selected, an empty VAT number is filled from a valid Norwegian organisation number on save. No duplicate entry is needed. Existing VAT numbers are preserved. Enable VAT only once registration is confirmed; assess its effective date separately.

