NorwayWizardTaskVATCompanyHelp=Check the VAT setting against the company’s actual registration. Do not enable it just because invoicing is starting. If the VAT number is empty, saving derives it from a valid organisation number when VAT is enabled.
NorwayWizardTaskRegistration=VAT registration effective date
NorwayWizardTaskRegistrationHelp=Only if registered: use the confirmed effective date from the registration documentation. Preview and confirm on the page. Leave it empty if not registered or the date is unknown. A saved date cannot be replaced from this page.
NorwayWizardTaskChart=Norwegian chart of accounts
NorwayWizardTaskChartHelp=Open the chart first. In a new setup, preview, install and select the Norwegian chart. If a chart or postings already exist, review them before making changes. You do not need to fill in all 745 accounts.
NorwayWizardTaskDefaults=Customer and supplier default accounts
NorwayWizardTaskDefaultsHelp=After selecting a chart, preview customer and supplier account suggestions. Confirm only if appropriate. This page only fills empty choices in a restricted new setup. Sales, purchases and VAT require separate review.
NorwayWizardTaskJournals=Posting journals
NorwayWizardTaskJournalsHelp=A journal groups postings of the same type. Preview missing sales, purchase, bank and general journals, and confirm if needed. Existing journals are preserved.
NorwayWizardTaskBank=Bank account
NorwayWizardTaskBankHelp=Create or open the company’s actual bank account. Enter the account number and payment details, and choose NOK. Review the ledger account and bank journal. Cheques must not be used.
NorwayWizardTaskBankLink=Connect the bank account to bookkeeping
NorwayWizardTaskBankLinkHelp=For a new setup with one ordinary NOK bank account, preview and confirm missing links here. If unavailable, review and configure the links manually on the bank account.
NorwayWizardTaskPartners=Customers and suppliers
NorwayWizardTaskPartnersHelp=Enter names, addresses, countries and relevant organisation/tax identifiers. Choose Norwegian or English document language per customer. This section also includes prospective customers.
NorwayWizardTaskProducts=Goods and services
NorwayWizardTaskProductsHelp=Create sale items with clear descriptions and NOK prices. The overview shows accounting codes and links to cards and product/service lists. Choose type, sales account and tax treatment according to the supply. State the delivery period for ongoing supplies. Free text is not translated automatically.
NorwayWizardTaskInvoice=Invoice setup
NorwayWizardTaskInvoiceHelp=Review automatic numbering, document model and payment terms before the first invoice. If invoices have already been issued, review the number sequence before changing it.
NorwayWizardTaskProposal=Proposal setup
NorwayWizardTaskProposalHelp=Review proposal numbering and document model. Make sure descriptions and terms suit the customer’s document language.
NorwayWizardTaskPDF=Review the documents
NorwayWizardTaskPDFHelp=Try Norwegian and English proposals, invoices and credit notes in a separate test environment. Review identities, supply, delivery time/place, amounts, VAT, due date and bank details. Credit notes must refer to the original invoice. Do not create synthetic documents in the live accounts.
NorwayWizardTaskPublic=Clarify public-sector customers
NorwayWizardTaskPublicHelp=If relevant, obtain the EHF recipient and buyer/order reference, and arrange an access point. The module does not provide EHF; a PDF does not replace it.
NorwayWizardTaskForeign=Clarify cross-border trade
NorwayWizardTaskForeignHelp=If relevant, record what is supplied, how it is supplied, the country and customer type for each purchase/sales scenario. Supplies may include goods, one-off services or ongoing supplies. Review tax treatment separately. Sales documents use NOK; EUR display is only an estimate.
NorwayWizardTaskBalances=Migration balances
NorwayWizardTaskBalancesHelp=Only when moving from another system: reconcile the bank, open customer/supplier items, VAT, assets, liabilities and equity at the same migration date. Retain source documents. Chart import does not migrate balances.
NorwayWizardTaskPeriods=Financial years and periods
NorwayWizardTaskPeriodsHelp=Review core financial years and periods. Document procedures for accruals, approval, locking and corrections. Keep private and business transactions separate.
NorwayWizardTaskReporting=Reporting responsibilities
NorwayWizardTaskReportingHelp=Decide who handles VAT returns, tax/business returns and any annual accounts filing. The module does not provide VAT returns, Norwegian SAF-T or authority submissions.
NorwayWizardTaskBackup=Backup and retention
NorwayWizardTaskBackupHelp=Arrange regular backups, a separate protected copy and a restore trial. Review retention, storage location, privacy and access. Update backups alone are not a complete retention strategy.
NorwayWizardTaskReview=Review decisions and remaining gaps
NorwayWizardTaskReviewHelp=Document decisions, responsible person and date. Mark unresolved and inapplicable items. Review relevant documents, postings, payments, reconciliation and reporting with the accounting professional before use.
NorwayWizardExtraRegistry=Registry lookup
NorwayWizardExtraRegistryHelp=Manually look up current company/VAT status. This does not save VAT settings or confirm historical effective dates.
NorwayWizardExtraVATCheck=VAT account check
NorwayWizardExtraVATCheckHelp=Shows rate rows and account links. Read only; it does not choose tax treatment for you.
NorwayWizardExtraAccountSettings=All default accounts
NorwayWizardExtraAccountSettingsHelp=Manual settings for sales, purchases, VAT and other fallback accounts. Requires your own accounting decisions.
NorwayWizardExtraJournalSettings=All journal settings
NorwayWizardExtraJournalSettingsHelp=Use to review or manually change existing journals.
NorwayWizardExtraAccountingCheck=Accounting setup check
NorwayWizardExtraAccountingCheckHelp=Shows the selected chart, default accounts and journals. Does not change settings.
NorwayWizardExtraDocumentCheck=Document setup check
NorwayWizardExtraDocumentCheckHelp=Shows current numbering, PDF models and languages without reserving numbers.
NorwayWizardExtraInvoiceCheck=Invoice check
NorwayWizardExtraInvoiceCheckHelp=Select an invoice to inspect fields and stored VAT amounts. Does not change documents.
NorwayWizardExtraPricing=Indicative EUR price
NorwayWizardExtraPricingHelp=Optional price estimate. The invoice and amount due remain in NOK.
NorwayWizardExtraPeriodCheck=Period check
NorwayWizardExtraPeriodCheckHelp=Shows date coverage, overlaps and period settings. Does not open or close periods.
NorwayWizardExtraAudit=Voucher check
NorwayWizardExtraAuditHelp=Shows ledger balance and document links. Does not replace bank, subledger or VAT reconciliation.
NorwayWizardExtraCoverage=Delivery status and gaps
NorwayWizardExtraCoverageHelp=Shows what the Norwegian module covers and what remains unfinished. Does not approve production use.
NorwayWizardBefore1=You have recorded the business scope and special circumstances requiring review.
NorwayWizardBefore2=Company details are saved, the base currency is NOK, and user access has been reviewed.
NorwayWizardBefore3=You know whether the company is VAT registered. If registered, the effective date is confirmed; otherwise it is recorded as unresolved. The setting and date do not approve tax treatment.
NorwayWizardBefore4=The chart is selected, customer/supplier accounts have been reviewed, and required journals exist. Review other default accounts and tax choices according to business needs.
NorwayWizardBefore5=Bank details, NOK, ledger account and bank journal have been checked. Balance and bank reconciliation are handled separately.
NorwayWizardBefore6=Customer details, document language, supply description, NOK price and relevant account/tax choices have been reviewed.
NorwayWizardBefore7=Numbering and document models have been reviewed. Actual Norwegian and English PDFs must be checked before sending.
NorwayWizardBefore8=Relevant EHF and cross-border scenarios are clarified or explicitly unresolved. Record if this step does not apply.
NorwayWizardBefore9=Financial years and periods are reviewed. Any migration balances and open items must be reconciled before use.
NorwayWizardBefore10=Reporting responsibilities and backup/retention procedures are documented. Missing reporting functions have an agreed solution outside the module.
NorwayWizardBefore11=Remaining gaps and responsibilities are documented. This page does not provide overall production approval.
