NorwayWizardTaskOtherAccounts=Default accounts and closing accounts
NorwayWizardTaskOtherAccountsHelp=Choose default accounts suitable for your goods and services. The overview also covers VAT, optional features and closing accounts. Preview before confirming. Existing choices remain.
