NorwayBatch=Invoice checks for a period
NorwayBatchScope=Read-only invoice checks by invoice date in the active company. Both dates are included. Documents without an invoice date are excluded. All statuses and invoice types are shown, including drafts, proformas and abandoned documents. Stored net/VAT totals are compared with line sums within 0.01. Amounts use the company base currency; no totals across documents are calculated. This is not ledger reconciliation, tax-treatment approval or a VAT return. No data changes.
