NorwayBatchEnd=To invoice date
NorwayBatchRun=Show invoice checks
NorwayBatchTruncated=The list is limited to the first 200 documents. Choose a shorter period to inspect the rest. This is not a complete period list.
NorwayBatchEmpty=No invoices dated in the selected period. Documents without an invoice date are not included.
NorwayBatchCount=Documents shown
NorwayBatchInvoice=Document
