NorwayBatchMissing=No lines to compare
NorwayBatchZero=Zero-rate/zero-VAT lines to review
NorwayBatchCurrency=Review currency; Norwegian scope requires NOK
NorwayBatchDates=Choose valid dates with the start on or before the end.
NorwayBatchReadError=Could not read the full invoice check. No period list can be shown.
