NorwayAmountsTaxCode=Stored tax code
NorwayAmountsTaxFlags=Special marker
NorwayTaxCodeMissing=No code stored
NorwayTaxCodeUnknown=Field unavailable
NorwayTaxFlagsUnknown=Field unavailable
NorwayTaxFlagsNone=No special marker
NorwayTaxFlagsPresent=Core marker – review required
NorwayTaxCountMissingCode=Lines without a stored tax code
NorwayTaxCountMarked=Lines with special markers
NorwayTaxCountUnknown=Lines with unavailable tax fields
NorwayTaxEvidenceScope=Tax codes and special markers are read from the stored invoice line. An empty code only means no code was stored; it does not by itself prove an error. Today’s rate dictionary is not used to fill in or interpret historical codes. Dolibarr special markers require review and are not interpreted as Norwegian tax codes. This is not historical VAT approval, SAF-T mapping or a VAT return.

NorwayAmountsTaxReference=SAF-T reference
NorwayTaxReferenceScope=The reference check only compares the exact code spelling with a fixed version of the official SAF-T list. A matching code does not confirm a mapping or correct tax treatment. A local code absent from the list may still be valid but needs an explicit mapping. No code is selected from a rate or amount.
NorwayTaxReferenceSource=Official code list (fixed revision)
NorwayTaxReferenceListed=Present in reference list – mapping unconfirmed
NorwayTaxReferenceUnlisted=Absent from reference list – local mapping needs review
NorwayTaxReferenceUnavailable=No available code to compare

NorwayMappingTitle=Try a mapping without saving
NorwayMappingScope=Choose one local code, one code from the official SAF-T list and first/last dates yourself. The comparison uses the invoice date and exact stored line code. No choice is made from the VAT rate. It applies only to the document you opened, including drafts and credit notes. The choice is not saved or used for posting or reporting. A match does not confirm correct tax treatment, deduction or a historical mapping.
NorwayMappingSource=Local code (exact spelling)
NorwayMappingTarget=Proposed SAF-T code
NorwayMappingStart=From date (inclusive)
NorwayMappingEnd=To date (inclusive)
NorwayMappingRun=Show possible matches
NorwayMappingUnsaved=Preview – not saved or applied. No totals or reporting are calculated.
NorwayMappingResult=Line result
NorwayMappingCandidate=Possible match – professional assessment still required
NorwayMappingOutside=Invoice date outside selected range
NorwayMappingUnknownDate=Invoice date unavailable
NorwayMappingUnavailable=Stored code missing or unavailable
NorwayMappingOtherCode=Different local code
NorwayMappingMarkers=Special or unknown marker – resolve first
NorwayMappingNoLines=No invoice lines to compare
NorwayMappingInvalid=Enter a non-empty local code of at most 10 bytes, an exact code from the SAF-T list and valid from/to dates in order. Control characters are not allowed.

NorwayMappingsTitle=Stored tax code mappings
NorwayMappingsScope=This is explicit configuration, not approval of tax treatment. Choose a local code, SAF-T code, date interval and sales or purchases. Overlapping intervals for the same local code and direction are blocked. Corrections and retirement append history; previous versions are preserved. Mappings are not yet used for posting, invoice validation or reporting. No old invoices change. This is not an immutable audit trail. Stored mappings require professional assessment before any future use.
NorwayMappingsCurrent=Latest version of each mapping
NorwayMappingsEmpty=No mappings have been stored.
NorwayMappingsCapacity=History versions used (including corrections):
NorwayMappingsNew=New mapping
NorwayMappingsEdit=Correct or retire mapping
NorwayMappingsDirection=Tax direction
NorwayMappingsSale=Sales
NorwayMappingsPurchase=Purchases
NorwayMappingsActive=Stored configuration – not applied
NorwayMappingsRetired=Retired configuration
NorwayMappingsRetire=Retire this mapping. Leave all other fields unchanged. Previous versions are preserved.
NorwayMappingsPreview=Preview change
NorwayMappingsPrevious=Previous version
NorwayMappingsConfirm=I confirm this configuration choice for the active entity. It is not accounting approval or reporting.
NorwayMappingsSave=Save new history version
NorwayMappingsSaved=A new version was saved. No documents or reports changed.
NorwayMappingsFailed=The change could not be completed. Check company identity, code, dates, direction and possible overlap. Create a new preview if it is stale. Invalid history or the capacity limit blocks saving; existing history is preserved.
