NorwayMappingsRevision=Revision
NorwayMappingsUser=User ID

NorwaySavedMappingTitle=Compare with a stored configuration revision
NorwaySavedMappingScope=Explicitly choose the configuration revision to try. No revision is selected automatically from the invoice date. The comparison uses today's stored invoice lines and invoice date, with sales mappings as they stood in the selected revision. Later corrections and retirements are not applied. A match is only a candidate; this is not posted tax evidence, historical approval or reporting. No data is changed or saved.
NorwaySavedMappingRevision=Configuration revision
NorwaySavedMappingChoose=Choose a revision
NorwaySavedMappingRun=Compare lines
NorwaySavedMappingSelected=Selected configuration revision
NorwaySavedMappingRule=Mapping / last correction in selected revision
NorwaySavedMappingCandidate=Possible match – professional assessment still required
NorwaySavedMappingNoRule=No sales mapping for this code and invoice date in the selected revision
NorwaySavedMappingUnknownDate=Invoice date unavailable
NorwaySavedMappingUnavailable=Stored line code missing or unavailable
NorwaySavedMappingMarkers=Special or unknown marker – resolve first
NorwaySavedMappingFailed=Could not compare the configuration. Check company identity and choose an existing revision. Invalid history is not used.

