NorwayInvoiceLedgerScope=Shows only bookkeeping rows pointing to this document in the active entity. Debit and credit are displayed as stored. An aggregated posting without a line reference may cover several invoice lines. A found reference does not confirm correct amounts, tax codes, tax bases or complete posting. No balance check, VAT allocation or reconciliation is calculated, and no data changes.
