NorwayEvidenceTitle=Invoice evidence control copies
NorwayEvidenceScope=Copies the currently stored invoice data, bookkeeping references and explicitly selected configuration revision. Validated or paid NOK invoices and credit notes with bookkeeping entries only, up to 200 lines and 200 entries. A copy does not approve bookkeeping or VAT treatment and does not establish the data at the original posting time. Missing codes and discrepancies require separate review.
NorwayEvidenceSaved=Control copy saved. Earlier copies are preserved.
NorwayEvidenceFailed=Unable to read or save the control copy. Review access, configuration and supported invoice scope. If the source changed, preview again.
NorwayEvidenceLines=invoice lines
NorwayEvidenceLedger=bookkeeping entries
