NorwayStandardReasonClosingProfit=2050 Other equity is the balance-sheet destination for profit. Do not treat 8800 or 8960 as equity accounts in this core field. This does not qualify automatic year-end closing.
NorwayStandardReasonClosingLoss=A sole proprietorship normally uses 2050 for losses as well. For a limited company, consider other equity first; 2080 is uncovered loss. One default field cannot split the loss between accounts. 8990 is result appropriation, not equity.
NorwayStandardClosingScope=Closing accounts are only one part of closing setup. Dolibarr also requires a closing journal and suitable balance-sheet/income-statement account groups. The chart import does not set these groups. Do not run automatic year-end closing before the complete workflow is qualified.
