NorwayStandardProductCodes=Accounting codes for products and services
NorwayStandardProductCodesHelp=Accounting codes are chart account numbers. The choices below set sales and purchase defaults for products and services. Domestic high-rate VAT sales suggest 3000 for goods and 3020 for services; goods purchased for resale may use 4300. Service purchases depend on the expense type. Codes on individual product/service cards override defaults. Open the card and edit its Accounting codes section when needed. This helper does not fill or overwrite individual cards. Other rates, exemptions and foreign trade require separate assessment.
