NorwayProductAccountsScope=The overview shows individual account codes and corresponding defaults for products and services in the active entity. Open the product/service card from its reference to edit accounting codes. Select the trade context to inspect its stored fields. This view saves nothing.
NorwayProductAccountsLimits=An available account only exists and is active in the selected chart. This does not approve its purpose, VAT rate, deduction rights or foreign trade. Third-party accounts, invoice lines, deposits and other modules may affect actual posting. The displayed VAT rate is the card default, not an invoice tax record.
