NorwayLineAccountsTitle=Persisted sales accounts on invoice lines
NorwayLineAccountsScope=Reads each persisted line account binding and compares net amounts per sales account with the ledger. Current product and default accounts are not used. Aggregated postings confirm account totals only, not each line amount. Account details are read as they exist now and do not prove original choices or historical tax treatment.
