NorwayPostingTitle=Source data observed at new posting creation
NorwayPostingScope=From this version, raw source data is preserved at supported new BOOKKEEPING_CREATE events for customer invoices. Earlier entries receive no reconstructed event history. The comparison checks current sources against the stored observation; it does not approve historical VAT treatment or provide a complete change log or VAT report. Times are UTC.
